Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How were such immense structures\Nplanned?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How were heavy materials moved\Ninto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How did builders keep each side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.92,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,aligned?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What tools made the work possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How was a project this complex
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,organized?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.22,0:00:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What did the pyramids mean to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the people who lived around them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.34,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Which clues are solid evidence,\Nand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,which interpretations remain\Ndebated?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That distinction matters, because\Nthis brief
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,includes no source notes to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So rather than turn uncertainty\Ninto
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,a confident story, we stop where
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.35,0:00:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the evidence stops.
